   6:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  *
   7:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * GND：接地引脚
   8:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * VCC：接电源引脚，接3.3V直流电源
   9:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * D0：SPI的时钟线SCLK（SCK）
  10:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * D1：SPI的数据线SDIN (MOSI)
  11:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * RES：复位接口，低电平初始化（复位），正常时高电平
  12:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * DC：用来选择命令or数据，低电平命令，高电平数据（0:命令 1:数据）
  13:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * CS：片选线，内部有上拉电阻，要做下拉使能低电平有效
  14:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * CUBEMX 选择SPI接口，MODE:Transmit Only Master,16分频为5Mbps左右 MOSI:PA7/CSK:PB3
  15:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  * 需要增加两个GPIO，默认高电平，配置为下拉 定义DC和RES接口DC:PB4/RES:PB5
  16:hal_bsp/hal/driver/spi_oled/ax_oled_1305.c ****  *
